    <content type="html">&lt;h2&gt;NVIDIA Nemotron 3.5 Super&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://ollama.com/library/nemotron-3.5-super&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;NVIDIA Nemotron 3.5 Super&lt;/a&gt; is a vision-language model for coding, reasoning, tool use, and document understanding. It pairs a 120B-parameter hybrid Mamba-2/Transformer mixture-of-experts backbone (12B active per token) with a C-RADIO vision encoder, and supports tool calling, an on/off thinking mode, and context up to 1M tokens.&lt;/p&gt;
